      "id": "claim_7280872df4ea42189aec2f6d05572b76",
      "statement": "The lighter commerce path is split across dedicated builder, cart, checkout, API, and tracking entrypoints: `/builder/lighters` loads the client-only builder, `/cart/lighters` renders the lighter cart, `/checkout/lighters` submits orders, and `/order-tracking/lighters/[slug]` looks up an order by its route slug.",
